{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Siblings Lesha and Diana are close, but separated by miles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day, they face difficulties in their cold, unfriendly cities, and their connection is maintained only through video calls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will they learn to appreciate each other in a new way after going through a series of dramatic events?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Our features</strong>:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- About 3 hours long narrative with a cosy, but at times tense atmosphere. Warm conversations are replaced by sad discoveries and ominous signs of fate that are yet to be unravelled.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Hand-drawn graphics with lots of CG art and backgrounds of wintertime St. Petersburg by experienced novel and anime artists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Professional voice acting by Ravencat studio \u2014 lifelike voices that bring the story even closer to your heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Musical accompaniment \u2014 from classical motifs to relaxing LoFi tracks that emphasise the mood of the scene.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Many subtle, barely noticeable details, despite the dynamic plot. Choices inevitably change the story.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3981550?t=1757429000","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981550/e3249a937d84dd8fb6aadc9ec5039dd9c1cb6df7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757429000","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981550/27cefdc1e346a04bd6c7e74450222726993f99fe/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757429000","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981550/27cefdc1e346a04bd6c7e74450222726993f99fe/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757429000","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Siblings Lesha and Diana are close, but separated by miles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day, they face difficulties in their cold, unfriendly cities, and their connection is maintained only through video calls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will they learn to appreciate each other in a new way after going through a series of dramatic events?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Our features</strong>:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- About 3 hours long narrative with a cosy, but at times tense atmosphere. Warm conversations are replaced by sad discoveries and ominous signs of fate that are yet to be unravelled.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Hand-drawn graphics with lots of CG art and backgrounds of wintertime St. Petersburg by experienced novel and anime artists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Professional voice acting by Ravencat studio \u2014 lifelike voices that bring the story even closer to your heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Musical accompaniment \u2014 from classical motifs to relaxing LoFi tracks that emphasise the mood of the scene.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Many subtle, barely noticeable details, despite the dynamic plot. Choices inevitably change the story.</p>","developers":["Remus"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981550/a5a21a078cd60a738706137f804045a43293dac8/header.jpg?t=1757429000","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257193094,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257193094/movie480.mp4?t=1756999763","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257193094/movie_max.mp4?t=1756999763"},"name":"The Tiny World trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257193094/35126f74c8be18dea8f2144c85a54cc1fbb38468/movie_600x